    privacy='''<section class="article-section"><h2>Visiting this site</h2><p>This is a static portfolio hosted on GitHub Pages. The site code does not add advertising trackers, analytics scripts, cookies or visitor accounts. The hosting provider may process connection information, such as IP addresses, to serve and secure the site.</p><h2>Project brief and email</h2><p>The project brief is assembled in your browser. Its fields are not submitted to this website or stored by the form. Opening a draft in Gmail or your email app passes the draft to that provider. A message reaches me only when you choose to send it.</p><p>Email enquiries are used to understand and respond to your request. Please avoid including private client records in a first enquiry; we can agree on suitable access and confidentiality arrangements.</p><h2>External links and downloads</h2><p>LinkedIn, GitHub, Gmail and other linked services have their own privacy practices. Research downloads are public. Private AlphaRose CRM records are not provided as downloads.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>For questions about information you have shared, email <a href="mailto:thisisfurqanahmad@gmail.com">thisisfurqanahmad@gmail.com</a>.</p><p class="fine-print">Last updated: 15 October 2026.</p></section>'''
